dtZip — Common Desktop Environment (CDE) Archive Manager
Drag-and-drop GUI for extracting and creating .zip, .tar.gz/.tgz, .tar.bz2/.tbz2,
.tar.xz/.txz, .tar, .7z, .rar (extract), .gz, .bz2, and .xz archives.
Styled natively to match CDE's active OSF/Motif palette.
"""

